# Shared Walk Stitch & Trajectory Certificates `A` (`FindAllJohnsonRampKickMuxHiCert64A`)

Chains checkpointed `r in {256, 512}` walk segments across `Hi64T17..24` and
certifies all `12` `rkmLo12EqHi` rows (`m in {2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64}`).
-/

namespace QuantumComputation.Specs.DickeSol

@[expose] public section

/-- Prepends `k` LSB-first bits of `< 2^50` word `w` onto `rest` (`HiCert64A`). -/
def rkmUnpackWordHi64A (rest : List Bool) : ℕ → ℕ → List Bool
  | 0, _ => rest
  | k + 1, w =>
    cond (Nat.ble 1 (Nat.mod w 2)) true false :: rkmUnpackWordHi64A rest k (Nat.div w 2)
/-- Unpacks `(len, word)` pairs into a `List Bool` sign-kick mask (`HiCert64A`). -/
def rkmUnpackMaskHi64A : List (ℕ × ℕ) → List Bool
  | [] => []
  | p :: ps => rkmUnpackWordHi64A (rkmUnpackMaskHi64A ps) p.1 p.2
